==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|fr}} {{term|suyvre|lang=frm}}, from {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{term|sivre|lang=fro}}, {{term|siure|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|VL.|fr}} {{term/t|la|*sequere}}, from {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|sequī|lang=la}}, present active infinitive of {{term|sequor|lang=la}}.

